{"id":10112,"name":"grimer-alola","speciesId":88,"dex":88,"form":"alolan","generation":1,"types":["poison","dark"],"stats":{"hp":80,"attack":80,"defense":50,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":50,"speed":25},"abilities":[{"name":"poison-touch","hidden":false},{"name":"gluttony","hidden":false},{"name":"power-of-alchemy","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":420,"baseExp":65,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10112.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10112.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10112.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10112.ogg","genus":"Sludge Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Appears in filthy areas. Thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Made of hardened sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won't grow in its path."},{"version":"gold","text":"As it moves, it loses bits of its body from which new GRIMER emerge. This worsens the stench around it."},{"version":"silver","text":"Wherever GRIMER has passed, so many germs are left behind that no plants will ever grow again."},{"version":"crystal","text":"When two of these POKéMON's bodies are combined together, new poisons are created."},{"version":"ruby","text":"GRIMER’s sludgy and rubbery body can be forced through any opening, however small it may be. This POKéMON enters sewer pipes to drink filthy wastewater."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"GRIMER emerged from the sludge that settled on a polluted seabed. This POKéMON loves anything filthy. It constantly leaks a horribly germ- infested fluid from all over its body."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Born from polluted sludge in the sea, GRIMER’s favorite food is anything filthy. They feed on wastewater pumped out from factories."},{"version":"firered","text":"Sludge exposed to X rays from the moon transformed into GRIMER. It loves feeding on filthy things."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"Appears in filthy areas. It thrives by sucking up polluted sludge that is pumped out of factories."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It was born when sludge in a dirty stream was exposed to the moon’s X-rays. It appears among filth."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"As it moves, it loses bits of its body, from which new GRIMER emerge. This worsens the stench around it."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Born from sludge, these Pokémon now gather in polluted places and increase the bacteria in their bodies."},{"version":"x","text":"Sludge exposed to X-rays from the moon transformed into Grimer. It loves feeding on filthy things."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Grimer’s sludgy and rubbery body can be forced through any opening, however small it may be. This Pokémon enters sewer pipes to drink filthy wastewater."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Grimer emerged from the sludge that settled on a polluted seabed. This Pokémon loves anything filthy. It constantly leaks a horribly germ-infested fluid from all over its body."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its main source of food is the slimy industrial waste of factories. This Pokémon’s numbers have been decreasing in recent years."},{"version":"moon","text":"It was born from sludge transformed by exposure to X-rays from the moon. When its internal load of germs decreases, it dies."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It was born from sludge on the ocean floor. In a sterile environment, the germs within its body can’t multiply, and it dies."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"The wastewater coming from factories is clean these days, so Grimer have nothing to eat. They’re said to be on the verge of extinction."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Made of congealed sludge. It smells too putrid to touch. Even weeds won’t grow in its path."}],"genderRate":4,"captur